# Paste the API_KEY from .env here (don't commit it).
@apiKey = change-me

### Health (no key needed)
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### Question in Hungarian
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/ask
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{"question": "Mi a növekedési adóhitel?"}

### Question in English, with top_k
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/ask
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{"question": "When is the corporate tax return due?", "top_k": 5}

### Not covered by the booklets
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/ask
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{"question": "Hogyan kell pizzát sütni?"}

### Invalid input (too short) -> 422
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/ask
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{"question": "a"}

### Missing API key -> 401
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{"question": "Mi a növekedési adóhitel?"}
